{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"596e12e88f20bda085f475cd8057e433ebcfbd7db4b18a72e7597b0902128ee5","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["審判鄰國"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華的默示應驗在哈得拉地大馬士革",{"text":"－世人和以色列各支派的眼目都仰望耶和華－","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和靠近的哈馬，並泰爾、西頓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為這二城的人大有智慧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"泰爾為自己修築保障，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"積蓄銀子如塵沙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"堆起精金如街上的泥土。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主必趕出她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打敗她海上的權利；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她必被火燒滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"亞實基倫看見必懼怕；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦薩看見甚痛苦；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以革倫因失了盼望蒙羞。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迦薩必不再有君王；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞實基倫也不再有居民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"私生子","poem":1},{"noteId":10},{"text":"必住在亞實突；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必除滅非利士人的驕傲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必除去他口中帶血之肉","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和牙齒內可憎之物。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必作為餘剩的人歸與我們的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必在猶大像族長；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以革倫人必如耶布斯人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在我家的四圍安營，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使敵軍不得任意往來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"暴虐的人也不再經過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我親眼看顧我的家。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["未來的君王"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"錫安的民哪，應當大大喜樂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷的民哪，應當歡呼。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，你的王來到你這裏！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他是公義的，並且施行拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"謙謙和和地騎着驢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是騎着驢的駒子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必除滅以法蓮的戰車","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和耶路撒冷的戰馬；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"爭戰的弓也必除滅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必向列國講和平；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的權柄必從這海管到那海，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從大河管到地極。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["上帝子民的復興"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"錫安哪，我因與你立約的血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將你中間被擄而囚的人從無水的坑中釋放出來。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們被囚而有指望的人都要轉回保障。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我今日說明，我必加倍賜福給你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我拿猶大作上弦的弓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我拿以法蓮為張弓的箭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"錫安哪，我要激發你的眾子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攻擊希臘","poem":1},{"noteId":11},{"text":"的眾子，使你如勇士的刀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和華必顯現在他們以上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的箭必射出像閃電。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華必吹角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乘南方的旋風而行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之耶和華必保護他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必吞滅仇敵，踐踏彈石。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必喝血吶喊，猶如飲酒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必像盛滿血的碗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像壇的四角滿了血。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"當那日，耶和華－他們的上帝","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必看他的民如群羊，拯救他們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們必像冠冕上的寶石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"高舉在他的地以上","poem":1},{"noteId":12},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的恩慈何等大！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的榮美何其盛！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"五穀健壯少男；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"新酒培養處女。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":10,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：外族人","reference":{"chapter":9,"verse":6}},{"noteId":11,"caller":"-","text":"原文是雅完","reference":{"chapter":9,"verse":13}},{"noteId":12,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：在他的地上發光輝","reference":{"chapter":9,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}